{
  "_comment": [
    "Route: /travel/* → http://mcp-travel:3100",
    "",
    "Requests arriving at PingGateway with a path beginning /travel are",
    "reverse-proxied to the Travel MCP server after stripping the /travel",
    "prefix so the upstream always sees /mcp, /health, etc.",
    "",
    "OPTIONAL JWT ENFORCEMENT",
    "─────────────────────────",
    "To have PingGateway validate Bearer tokens centrally (instead of each",
    "MCP server validating independently), uncomment the OAuth2ResourceServer-",
    "Filter in the 'filters' array below and set the OIDC_ISSUER /",
    "OIDC_JWKS_URI environment variables on the gateway container.",
    "",
    "When centralized enforcement is active you can set SKIP_AUTH=true in",
    "the mcp-travel service to avoid double-validation."
  ],
  "name": "mcp-travel",
  "condition": "${find(request.uri.path, '^/travel')}",
  "handler": {
    "type": "Chain",
    "config": {
      "filters": [
        {
          "_comment": "Strip the /travel prefix before forwarding to the upstream.",
          "name": "StripTravelPrefix",
          "type": "ScriptableFilter",
          "config": {
            "type": "application/x-groovy",
            "source": [
              "def newPath = request.uri.path.replaceFirst('^/travel', '')",
              "request.uri.path = newPath ?: '/'",
              "return next.handle(context, request)"
            ]
          }
        }

        /*
         * OPTIONAL: Uncomment to validate Bearer tokens at the gateway layer.
         *
         * Requires:
         *   - OIDC_ISSUER and OIDC_JWKS_URI env vars set on the pinggateway service
         *   - The token audience must include http://mcp-travel:3100 or the value
         *     you registered as the travel Resource in PingOne
         *
        ,{
          "name": "TravelJwtValidator",
          "type": "OAuth2ResourceServerFilter",
          "config": {
            "accessTokenResolver": {
              "type": "StatelessAccessTokenResolver",
              "config": {
                "issuer": "${system['OIDC_ISSUER']}",
                "verificationSecretId": "jwks",
                "secretsProvider": {
                  "type": "JwkSetSecretStore",
                  "config": {
                    "jwkUrl": "${system['OIDC_JWKS_URI']}"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
        */
      ],
      "handler": {
        "name": "TravelMcpProxy",
        "type": "ReverseProxyHandler",
        "config": {
          "baseURI": "http://mcp-travel:3100",
          "responseTimeout": "10 minutes"
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
